OL,3,AThousands without power as Isaias
OL,4,Aprompts evacuation orders across Gulf
OL,5,ACoast
OL,6,
OL,7,FHurricane Isaias is likely to bring a
OL,8,F"life-threatening storm surge" to the
OL,9,FUS Gulf Coast, the National Hurricane
OL,10,FCenter warns
OL,12,FThe storm peaked as a category 3 but
OL,13,Fhas since been downgraded to a category
OL,14,F2 and will make landfall in the next
OL,15,Fcouple of hours
OL,17,FPeople on the coast of the Florida
OL,18,Fpanhandle have already been told to
OL,19,Fseek immediate shelter under an
OL,20,F"Extreme Wind Warning"
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
