OL,3,AThousands without power as Isaias
OL,4,Aprompts evacuation orders across Gulf
OL,5,ACoast
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of thousands are without power
OL,8,Fin the country's southeast - and
OL,9,FAlabama, Florida and Georgia have
OL,10,Fissued states of emergency as they
OL,11,Fprepare for flooding from the heavy
OL,12,Frain
OL,14,FOne Florida resident tells the BBC that
OL,15,F"everyone's gone", but he's remaining
OL,16,Fin his home, securing his ducks and
OL,17,Fchickens in the bathroom
OL,19,FUS President Donald Trump is no longer
OL,20,Fattending a major American football
OL,21,Fcollege game in Tuscaloosa, Alabama
OL,22,Fbecause of the hurricane
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
